<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - Sept 24.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - Sept 24.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flights may be postponed at</p>
<p>airports of central Russia on Wednesday morning due to heavy fog, the Russian Weather Service said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The probability of the forecast being accurate is 70 percent, it said.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
